  "content": "[Intro]\n[D]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D]I can show you the\nworld [A]\n[D]Shining, shimmering,\n[A][Bm]splendid\n[Em]Tell me, [F#]princess, now\n[Bm]when did [A]You last\n[G]let your heart decide?\n[D]\nI can open your\neyes [A]\n[D]Take you wonder by\n[A][Bm]wonder\n[Em]Over, [F#]sideways and\n[Bm]under [A]On a\n[G]magic carpet ride\n[D]A whole new\n\n[Chorus 1 (Aladdin)]\n[A]world\n[D]A new fan-\n[A]tastic point of view\n[D]No one to\n[G]tell us, [D]\"no\" Or\n[G]where to go [D]Or\n[Bm]say we're only drea-\n[A]ming A whole new\n\n[Chorus 2 (Jasmine)]\n[A]world\n[D]A dazzling\n[A]place I [F#]never knew\n[Bm][D]But when I'm\n[G]way up here [D]It's\n[G]crystal clear [D]That\n[Bm]now I'm in a\n[C]whole new [A]world with you\n[D]Now I'm in a whole\nnew world with you\n\n[Verse 2]\n[F]Unbelievable\nsights\nIndescribable\n[C][Dm]feeling\n[Gm]Soaring, [A]tumbling, free-\n[Dm]wheeling Through an\n[Bb]endless diamond sky\n[F]A whole new\n\n[Chorus 3]\n[C]world\n[F]A hundred\n[C]thousand things to see\n[F]I'm like a\n[Bb]shooting star [F]I've\n[Bb]come so far [F]I\n[Dm]can't go back to\n[C]where I used to be A whole new\n\n[Chorus 4]\n[C]world\n[F]With new ho-\n[C]rizons [A]to pursue\n[Dm][F]I'll chase them\n[Bb]anywhere [F]There's\n[Bb]time to spare [F]\n[Dm]Let me share this\n[Eb]whole new [C]world with\n[Dm]you\n[F]A whole new\n\n[Outro]\n[Bb]world A whole new\n[F]world That's where we'll\n[Gm]be That's where we'll\n[F]be A thrilling\n[Bb]chase A wondrous place\n[C]For you and\n[F]me",
